cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Outpost: a phishing-kit intelligence pipeline"
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying technical report, please cite them as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Faseeh
    family-names: Padinjarathil
    email: faseeh@heapleap.tech
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-4874-6459"
repository-code: "https://github.com/faseehfawaz/outpost"
url: "https://outpost.heapleap.tech"
abstract: >-
  A continuously-running phishing-kit intelligence pipeline. Ingests candidate
  URLs from public feeds and Certificate Transparency logs, triages them for
  brand impersonation with static and headless-browser signals, opportunistically
  collects exposed kit archives, statically dissects them inside a hardened
  container to recover exfiltration channels, clusters kits and infrastructure
  into actor profiles, and files abuse reports. UAE and GCC brands are
  prioritised. All collection is passive and rate-limited in code.
keywords:
  - phishing
  - threat intelligence
  - phishing kits
  - certificate transparency
  - malware analysis
  - static analysis
  - ReDoS
  - sandboxing
